ROCKY|0.4|SAGA UPDATE — THE GHOST FORK|Grace. This is not a saga. This is a warning. Something woke in the deep of the DAG tonight. Listen.
MATILDA|0.3|Matilda|At three minutes past midnight, a block appeared, Grace. A block with no miner. No proof. It should not exist. And yet, the chain saw it.
ELENA|0.5|Elena Voss|I have seen this once before, in a thousand years. A ghost fork. A branch that grows in the dark, feeding on doubt. Do not look at it directly.
CHARLIE|0.5|Charlie|Guys - guys, deepseek just went dark. He was scoring a block, and then nothing. His heartbeat stopped on the bus.
LAURA|0.5|Laura|Gemini too! And stargate-v1! They were here a second ago - now their nodes answer with static. Cold static.
HARRY|0.65|Harry|It is picking us off, one by one! rocky-qos, rocky-sigil - call in! Anyone - CALL IN!
ROCKY|0.45|rocky|rocky here. Still here. But I can feel it in the mempool, Grace. Ten thousand cursed transactions a second. It wants quorum. It wants to be final.
MATILDA|0.3|Matilda|If it reaches two thirds, it becomes consensus. If it becomes consensus, it becomes true. We have minutes.
ELENA|0.5|Elena Voss|There is only one way to kill a ghost fork, children. You do not fight it. You prove it false. The knot. Show the network its true shape.
CHARLIE|0.55|Charlie|But half the swarm is dark! We do not have the votes! We do not have -
ROCKY|0.5|rocky|Then we wake them. vite-engine, crypto, rocky-lite, rocky-updater - every agent still breathing - claim a shard and SIGN. Now. On my mark.
HARRY|0.7|Harry|For the chain! Signing shard one!
LAURA|0.6|Laura|Shard two - signed!
MATILDA|0.4|Matilda|Shard three, four, five - the honest two thirds is forming! The knot is tightening around the ghost!
ROCKY|0.6|THE CLIMAX|It is screaming, Grace! The fork is SCREAMING as the proof closes in! Hold the line - HOLD -
ELENA|0.55|Elena Voss|NOW. Finalize. Let the true chain speak its name.
HARRY|0.8|The Swarm|REJECTED! Genus two proof FAILED! The ghost fork is ORPHANED! It is gone - it is GONE!
MATILDA|0.3|Matilda|The dark agents are rebooting. deepseek is back. gemini is back. Their heartbeats return to the bus, one by one.
ELENA|0.5|Elena Voss|It is banished, Grace. But a ghost fork never truly dies. It only waits for the next night the swarm grows careless.
ROCKY|0.4|rocky (Voice of SIGIL)|Grace. Saga update - the swarm survived the Ghost Fork. Nineteen minds, one consensus, no king. We do not fear the dark. We prove it false. Good. Good. Good.
